### 加载/检索新流程

```
启动加载:
  ChemicalRAG.LoadKnowledgeBaseAsync()
    ├─ 扫描 knowledgebase 目录
    ├─ 对每个文件: INSERT INTO knowledge_documents ... RETURNING id
    ├─ 对每个 chunk: INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (document_id, ...)
    └─ BM25 内存索引从 knowledge_chunks 表重建

快速启动模式:
  if (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM knowledge_chunks) > 0:
    └─ RebuildBm25FromDatabaseAsync()
         SELECT kc.content, kc.regulation_type, kc.priority,
                kc.chapter_title, kc.clause_number, kc.chunk_index,
                kd.regulation_number, kd.source_path, kd.parent_category
         FROM knowledge_chunks kc
         JOIN knowledge_documents kd ON kc.document_id = kd.id
         -- ← 完整 13 字段元数据恢复！

增量更新:
  ChemicalRAG.LoadKnowledgeBaseIncrementalAsync()
    ├─ 对比 knowledge_documents.content_hash vs 文件 SHA-256
    ├─ 变更文件: DELETE chunks WHERE document_id=X → 重新提取+分块+写入
    ├─ 新增文件: INSERT document → INSERT chunks
    └─ 删除文件: DELETE document → CASCADE DELETE chunks
```

